Auto Steal, Egg Predictor and Halloween Auto Farm.\n\nTarget the pets you want, automate egg hatching and manage your base alongside dedicated Halloween event features.\n\n⚡ INSTANT STEAL & AUTO STEAL\n• Instant Steal in both the Normal World and Halloween World.\n• Select your target directly from the live egg list.\n• Auto Instant Steal prioritizes the highest-paying egg matching your filters.\n• Filter normal-world targets by area, rarity and specific pet.\n• Mutated-only targeting for eggs with mutations.\n• Halloween egg lists with income, rarity and zone sorting.\n\n🎃 HALLOWEEN AUTO FARM\n• Auto Collect Halloween Eggs and deliver them for Candy Corn.\n• Select the Halloween zones you want to farm.\n• Auto Pumpkin Moon Event: collect pumpkins and return them to the altar.\n• Auto Hunt Halloween Monsters.\n• Auto Ghost Dog Quest for Haunted Rod and Train Pass progression.\n• Auto Haunted Fishing, including ghost fish.\n• Auto Phantom Express: board the train and catch ghosts for souls.\n• Auto Trade Souls for Spectral Mutations.\n\n🔮 EGG PREDICTOR\n• View live eggs currently available on the map.\n• Track upcoming rare-pet spawn estimates based on observed spawn history.\n• Browse recent rare-pet sightings from other servers.\n• View your placed hatching eggs.\n• Search by pet and filter results by area or rarity.\n• Dedicated Halloween predictions and event timers.\n• Predictions are estimates, not guaranteed future spawns.\n\n🐣 AUTO HATCH & PET MANAGEMENT\n• Auto Place Eggs with pet, rarity and mutation filters.\n• Choose placement priority and limit eggs on your base.\n• Auto Hatch fully grown eggs.\n• Auto Equip Best Pets based on income.\n• Auto Upgrade Base when affordable.\n• Auto Mutate Eggs using your existing mutation items.\n• Auto Sell Eggs and Pets by selected rarities.\n• Keep selected pets, mutated pets and high-income eggs using configurable protection rules.\n\n🦋 BUTTERFLY EVENT\n• Auto Catch Butterflies.\n• Auto Wisp Quest and Butterfly Net collection.\n• Auto Butterfly Trade Up.\n• Auto Craft Enchanted Essence when you have the required butterflies.\n\n⚙️ EXTRA TOOLS\n• Anti-AFK and Auto Rejoin.\n• Anti Knockback, Anti Ragdoll and Anti Trap options.\n• Low Graphics, texture removal and adjustable FPS cap.\n• Solo-server browser.","tags":[],"discord":"https://discord.gg/axonhub","keyLink":"https://discord.gg/axonhub","owner":{"_id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","username":"AxonHub","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/be778f9b422b14752293b779e984297eb2b2d3d961fd673dc32f2a4a2dcb900a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece-1766868990008.png"},"lvl":14,"status":"offline","id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"week","rank":14,"period":"week","metric":"views","value":42859}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.streak","tier":30},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/be778f9b422b14752293b779e984297eb2b2d3d961fd673dc32f2a4a2dcb900a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece-1766868990008.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":50,"conf":0.2,"n":{"w":1,"b":1,"p":0,"d":0,"k":1},"total":2,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":1,"at":"2026-10-22T22:14:00.051Z","last":"bw","win":14,"math":4,"upd":1,"why":{"ke":1}},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a8096503064cb7d61a50e1c","editBy":{"_id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","username":"AxonHub","status":"offline","id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-08-15T16:39:44.690Z"},{"_id":"6ad9d6010b41261289ed0524","editBy":{"_id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","username":"AxonHub","status":"offline","id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-10-22T09:23:13.202Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a820b7edc2094b1bdb6befd","commentBy":{"_id":"696ff36b3593559f36ddb741","username":"snowy","verified":true,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"ht